{"lyrics":"[00:06.82]Yeah, no, no, no, no, no, uh\n[00:07.32]What the fuck? Uh, Perc'\n[00:07.94](CB On The Beat, Ho)\n[00:08.36]Perc', mm-mm\n[00:13.40]Bitch, huh, huh\n[00:14.62]Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted\n[00:16.74]Wasted, I'm on these drugs, I feel wasted\n[00:20.04]Wasted, get her off my mind when I'm wasted\n[00:23.36]Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted\n[00:26.66]Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted\n[00:29.98]Wasted, I'm on these drugs, I feel wasted\n[00:33.28]Wasted, get her off my mind when I'm wasted\n[00:36.60]Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted, wasted\n[00:40.70]She do cocaine in my basement\n[00:43.66]I'm a doctor, but I'm runnin' out of patience\n[00:47.76]She told me that she tryna get closer to Satan\n[00:50.24]She be talkin' to him when she in the matrix\n[00:53.54]Damn, why is she so demonic?\n[00:56.84]She Medusa with a little Pocahontas\n[01:00.14]She been lacin' all my drugs or somethin'\n[01:03.04]'Cause every time that we're together, I'm unconscious\n[01:06.52]Hold up, uh, let me be honest\n[01:09.96]I know I saw her put the Percs in my chronic\n[01:13.12]Smoke until my eyes roll back like The Omen\n[01:16.28]Just another funeral for her, goddamn (Huh)\n[01:19.70]Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted\n[01:22.94]Wasted, I'm on these drugs, I feel wasted\n[01:26.26]Wasted, get her off my mind when I'm wasted\n[01:29.56]Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted\n[01:32.86]Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted\n[01:36.18]Wasted, I'm on these drugs, I feel wasted\n[01:39.48]Wasted, get her off my mind when I'm wasted\n[01:42.80]Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted, wasted\n[01:46.90]She do cocaine in my basement\n[01:49.88]I'm a doctor, but I'm runnin' out of patience\n[01:53.04]She told me that she tryna get closer to Satan\n[01:56.44]She be talkin' to him when she in the matrix\n[01:59.40]Rockstar, that's our style, these boys can't take it (Yeah)\n[02:02.66]Hatin', but they're still tryna take our cadence (Woah)\n[02:05.74]N